+      'VITE_BACKEND_URL / VITE_USER_BACKEND in the deploy environment) and ' +
+      'VITE_USE_RELATIVE_PATH is not "true". A bundle baked without either ' +
+      'would ship degraded viewer mode and white-screen on every API call.',
